\newlabel{fig:seam:b}{{10}{56}{Iteration 13, flip toward cam1. Opposite direction of the same failure: upper half is cam1's composition, lower half is cam0's crop. Seam at a similar phase of the DMA cycle}{figure.caption.7}{}}
