\newlabel{fig:postfix:cam0}{{13}{58}{Post-fix cam0 frame, same \texttt {switch\_drain=1} setting. No seam; whole frame is cam0's composition with the teal mug visible in the upper right, evenly exposed}{figure.caption.8}{}}
